      "statement_ref": "SM 1078-018, Sec 1",
      "statement_text": "The purpose of this memorandum is to delegate authority under the \"Service First\" initiative to the Assistant Secretary for Administration at the Department of Agriculture (USDA) to create a co-location program for Federal offices and facilities leased by the USDA. This furthers the Administration's Return-to-Office initiative and promotes customer service and efficiency.",
